# Rehan CRM Agency — Firebase Web App configuration
#
# This file IS committed to git on purpose. Firebase web config values are not
# secrets: they ship inside the client JavaScript bundle of every Firebase web
# app, so anyone can read them from the browser. What actually protects your data
# is firestore.rules (tenant + role checks) and the Authorized domains list in
# Firebase Authentication settings. Keep both of those tight.
#
# Never put real secrets here (service account keys, admin SDK credentials, API
# secrets). Those belong in .env.local, which stays gitignored.
#
# Source: Firebase console > Project settings > General > Your apps > Web app
# Project: crm-project-7431d

